    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Medical is a professional, user-friendly, and fully responsive theme ideal for hospitals, clinics, healthcare centers, nursing homes, medical shops, doctors, dentists, surgeons, physiotherapists, pediatricians, gynecologists, cardiologists, and other health-related institutions, while also supporting ecommerce templates, online store building, pharmacy shops, health product sales, wellness equipment stores, and dropshipping medical supplies; with WooCommerce integration, it allows selling medicines, supplements, lab test kits, medical devices, and healthcare products, while a prominent banner section, team showcase, service listings, and blog for health tips or medical updates help build trust and engage patients, and Contact Form 7 plus Appointment Booking streamline inquiries, online consultations, and patient scheduling; fully customizable layouts, color schemes, and typography enable brand consistency, while Yoast SEO compatibility enhances search visibility for medical services, healthcare products, and online pharmacy searches, ensuring fast loading, mobile-optimized performance, accessible navigation, and a conversion-focused platform for healthcare providers, online medical stores, and wellness-focused ecommerce businesses."
    },
